# Vespera Dusk — Project

## Stack (locked — do not bump without an explicit brief)

- Next.js **16.4.6** App Router (`src/`), Turbopack
- React **19.3.1** / React DOM **19.3.1**
- Tailwind CSS **4.3.5** (CSS-first `@theme`)
- TypeScript **5.9.3** + ESLint **9** (TS 7 / ESLint 10 not supported by current eslint plugins yet)
- GSAP **3.15.1**, `@gsap/react` **2.1.2**, Lenis **1.3.27**
- Package manager: pnpm

## Step discipline

- Follow `docs/plan.md`. One step = one branch (`step-NN-slug`) = one reviewable change.
- Implement **only** the current brief. Never expand scope, sneak in later steps, or “just add” motion/UI early.
- Do **not** touch `package.json` versions unless the brief says so.
- Read `AGENTS.md` before writing Next.js code — this Next may differ from training data.
- Prefer `design-handoff/` over live Figma when MCP quota is exhausted.
- All copy is placeholder; centralize in `src/content/site.ts` from Step 2 onward.
- Nabeel merges to `main` only on explicit OK. See `docs/workflow.md`.

## Verify before review

```bash
pnpm lint && pnpm build
```
